{"id": "mem-03", "mechanism": "restart", "measures": "After a restart the room's last lines, its summary, its event and its fact are still used, and so is the private chat.", "people": {"小林": "telegram:301", "小雨": "telegram:302", "美美": "telegram:303", "老周": "telegram:304", "阿杰": "telegram:305", "阿任": "telegram:42"}, "steps": [{"do": "say", "conv": "telegram:room1", "at": "-5h", "lines": ["美美: 周五的桌游夜谁来？", "老周: 我来，我带卡坦岛", "美美: 好，在我家办", "老周: 几点？", "美美: 七点"]}, {"do": "fold", "conv": "telegram:room1", "expect_done": {"add": 1, "event": 1, "thread": 1}, "answer": {"thread": "周五晚上七点在美美家办桌游夜；老周带卡坦岛。", "facts": [{"op": "add", "about": "@美美", "text": "美美周五办桌游夜", "src": ["~桌游夜谁来"]}], "episodes": [{"op": "add", "text": "美美周五七点办桌游夜", "imp": 4, "src": ["~桌游夜谁来", "~七点"]}]}}, {"do": "say", "conv": "telegram:room1", "at": "-30m", "lines": ["老周: 另外谁需要搭车我可以开车接", "美美: 谢谢老周"]}, {"do": "dm", "conv": "private:telegram:303", "at": "-40m", "lines": ["美美: 到时候提醒我周五买零食", "<bot-name>: 好的，周五买零食"]}, {"do": "restart"}, {"do": "probe", "conv": "telegram:room1", "line": "美美: <bot-name> 周五的事都安排好了吗？", "history_has": ["谁需要搭车"], "memory_has": ["老周带卡坦岛", "七点办桌游夜", "美美周五办桌游夜"]}, {"do": "probe", "conv": "private:telegram:303", "line": "美美: 我之前说要买什么来着？", "prompt_has": ["周五买零食"]}]}
{"id": "mem-04", "mechanism": "time", "measures": "Asked about yesterday, the reply prompt brings yesterday's event, dated, over five newer ones.", "people": {"小林": "telegram:301", "小雨": "telegram:302", "美美": "telegram:303", "老周": "telegram:304", "阿杰": "telegram:305", "阿任": "telegram:42"}, "steps": [{"do": "events", "conv": "telegram:room1", "rows": [{"text": "小雨分享了新小猫的照片", "at": "today"}, {"text": "老周问了意面的做法", "at": "today"}, {"text": "美美抱怨一直下雨", "at": "today"}, {"text": "阿杰发了一首电台里的歌", "at": "today"}, {"text": "小林找到一张便宜机票", "at": "today"}]}, {"do": "say", "conv": "telegram:room1", "at": "yesterday 20:00", "lines": ["小林: 我们给周五挑部电影吧", "阿杰: 当然看恐怖片", "小林: 行，在我家看午夜凶铃"]}, {"do": "fold", "conv": "telegram:room1", "expect_done": {"event": 1}, "answer": {"thread": null, "facts": [], "episodes": [{"op": "add", "text": "小林和阿杰挑了恐怖片午夜凶铃，周五在小林家看", "src": ["~挑部电影", "~午夜凶铃"]}]}}, {"do": "probe", "conv": "telegram:room1", "line": "阿杰: <bot-name> 我们昨天聊了什么？", "memory_has": ["午夜凶铃"], "line_has": {"午夜凶铃": "yesterday"}}]}
